@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Accordion}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Accordion @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview</PageTitle>

<h1>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Accordion @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview</h1>

<p>
    The accordion is a component that displays a list of items where each item has a header and a content panel.
    Clicking the header expands or collapses ts associated panel.
</p>
<p>
    This implemenation of the Accordion pattern has options that allow you to expand or collapse multiple panels or configure it
    to only allow only one panel be open at a time.
</p>
<p>
    Below is an example of the accordion component in a section with a heading of "Lifestyle Accordion". I have included heading icons (which are optional), and set the <span class="code-span">ExpandMode</span>
    to mulitple which allows muliple panels to be open at the same time. I have also set the <span class="code-span">PersistContent</span> parameter
    to true so the content remains (hidded) in the DOM when the panels are collapsed.
</p>
<section class="section-box">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:var(--br-unit-space-9);">Lifestyle Accordion</h2>

    <Accordion HeadingLevel="HeadingLevel.H3" ExpandMode="ExpandMode.Multiple" style="margin-bottom:var(--br-unit-space-7)">
        <AccordionItem HeadingText="Food" PanelHasTabIndex="true" PanelIsRegion="false" SvgIcon="--svg-food-icon" PersistContent="true">
            <PanelContent>
                <p>
                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Proin sit amet sem vulputate, interdum justo vitae, sagittis nulla. Ut lectus augue, consectetur ut massa id,
                    tristique luctus eros. Donec tempus augue velit, vel vehicula tellus consequat vel. Integer tristique sem ac nisi sodales placerat. Integer nulla ex, tincidunt ut
                    eleifend ut, vestibulum vel leo. Proin diam urna, finibus porttitor purus nec, tristique varius justo. Nunc vel dui sed dui elementum facilisis. Curabitur ac fermentum
                    urna. Integer vestibulum fermentum massa, quis auctor elit viverra eget.
                </p>
            </PanelContent>
        </AccordionItem>
        <AccordionItem HeadingText="Travel" PanelHasTabIndex="true" PanelIsRegion="false" SvgIcon="--svg-airplane-icon" PersistContent="true">
            <PanelContent>
                <p>
                    Nulla eu est lacus. Mauris sodales tortor in sem viverra porta. Nam in dapibus massa. Vivamus et augue quis mauris luctus pretium eu eu dolor. Maecenas gravida nisl non
                    ante facilisis, pulvinar vestibulum nibh sagittis. Pellentesque mollis sem at arcu mattis, id molestie augue cursus. Pellentesque dolor urna, ultricies quis iaculis ac,
                    rutrum luctus nulla. Integer et consequat erat. Sed eget metus in est pulvinar ultrices at nec lorem. Sed aliquam massa eget dui aliquet ullamcorper. Sed elit nisi, maximus
                    et erat molestie, bibendum rutrum diam. Phasellus cursus eleifend porta.
                </p>
            </PanelContent>
        </AccordionItem>
        <AccordionItem HeadingText="Exercise" PanelHasTabIndex="true" PanelIsRegion="false" SvgIcon="--svg-runner-icon" PersistContent="true">
            <PanelContent>
                <p>
                    Mauris imperdiet nisi nec pulvinar porta. Sed semper viverra venenatis. Sed accumsan, erat condimentum ornare malesuada, erat mauris tincidunt enim, non interdum quam sem
                    ac velit. Nunc et enim lorem. Maecenas gravida tortor eget ligula efficitur ullamcorper. Cras ut nisi elementum, maximus ante eu, vestibulum nibh. Vestibulum nec iaculis elit,
                    sit amet sagittis ex.
                </p>
            </PanelContent>
        </AccordionItem>
    </Accordion>
</section>

<h3>Source code for the accordion example</h3>
<CodeBox CodeBlock="@AccordionSnippets.Accordion_Setting_Parameters_Example" AriaLabel="Accordion code example" />

<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Getting_Started}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Roadmap}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Getting_Started_Name - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Roadmap</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Accordion}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Installation}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Accordion - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Installation</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>
